  "scope": "Three public requests at seed 8102. Representative functional room groups; not the full style acceptance matrix.",
  "findings": [
    "The parapet roof and earth palette are recognizable cues, but the shell is a single broad rectangular block with no useful terrace, roof access or stepped mass hierarchy.",
    "Interior furniture repeats raised single beds, high wood tables/chairs, metal-band chests and barrels; it does not follow the target's fitted earthen surfaces and compact household material vocabulary.",
    "The default arrival room includes the sleeping bed by the entrance. Privacy and gathering hierarchy are unclear.",
    "The default parlour is a tight generic dining arrangement between long bare walls. The large rooms have broad empty wall and floor runs.",
    "Cooking stations are isolated workbenches with pots and crates; the stores remain generic barrel/chest groups.",
    "The large facade repeats small windows and a tiny entrance. Roof construction, terrace drainage and thresholds need plan-owned architectural purpose."
  ],
